01:19:45,000 --> 01:19:51,000
Wake Up Dead Man (marketed as Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery) is a
2025 American mystery film written and directed by Rian Johnson.

12
01:27:00,000 --> 01:27:06,000
It is the third film in the Knives Out series.

13
01:34:15,000 --> 01:34:21,000
The film stars Daniel Craig, who reprises his role
as master detective Benoit Blanc.

14
01:41:30,000 --> 01:41:36,000
In the film, Blanc investigates the death of a divisive Catholic
priest against the backdrop of a missing inheritance.

15
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:51,000
The ensemble cast also includes Josh O'Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner,
Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.

16
01:56:00,000 --> 01:56:06,000
The film had its world premiere at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 6, 2025, and was
released in select theaters on November 26, 2025, before streaming on Netflix on December 12, 2025.

17
02:03:15,000 --> 02:03:21,000
Like its predecessors, it received generally positive reviews, with most praise
for the performances, in particular those of Craig and O'Connor.

18
02:10:30,000 --> 02:10:36,000
The film explores themes of detective, investigation, sequel, murder, whodunit.

